dex":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041504117:1":{"text":"はっ、てっきりお前はもっと強い奴だと思ったよ。","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈，索尼娅，我还以为你是强者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x242CB83865FD066A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041504118:1":{"text":"なのに、まるで俺を哀れんでいるような言い草だな。","source_cn":"但瞧你对我说话的语气，你竟然在悲悯我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x969CEA4B06D1CE45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041504119:1":{"text":"弱者が強者を哀れむなど、笑止千万！","source_cn":"弱者竟敢悲悯强者？多可笑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DD9E20F75C7C774","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041504120:1":{"text":"俺がまだイモータル号にいたなら、今頃お前の首を船首に吊していただろうな。","source_cn":"要是我还在不死号上，你的头已经被我挂在船头了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE6025F0B6D70C22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1041504121:1":{"text":"死と苦しみで他人を脅迫するのは、お前自身がそれを恐れているからだろう？","source_cn":"你用死亡和折磨来恐吓别人，不就是因为你一直生活在这种恐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B254EA935138807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1041504122:1":{"text":"ホジキン、あたしの前で見栄を張る必要はない。お前の力量などとっくに分かっている。","source_cn":"霍德希金，你不必在我面前自诩强者。你早就暴露了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77C7954CBA54A051","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1041504123:1":{"text":"お前は、常に恐怖に怯えているただの道化だ。","source_cn":"你只是一直生活在恐惧中的小丑而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3B429A77BF142C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1041504124:1":{"text":"ふん……口だけはよく回る奴だな。","source_cn":"哼……嘴皮子功夫再厉害也没有意义。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x335F5CEE6C120DCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1041504125:1":{"text":"図星か？すまないな、あたしは回りくどいことが嫌いなんだ。","source_cn":"戳到了你的痛处吗？真抱歉，我向来不喜欢绕弯子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DB23F243876E11A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1041504126:1":{"text":"それが嫌ならもう話しかけないでくれ。","source_cn":"不想听，那就别来打扰我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90C3C1FBE4AEE192","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1041504127:1":{"text":"お前の手には、あたしの仲間たちの血が染みこんでいることを忘れるな。","source_cn":"别忘了，你的手上还沾着我血薇帮兄弟的血！","status":"mat